------ Deferred from the /pitching + /batting restructure ------
outings.date is String(20) holding dates -- should be db.Date
  Works today only because ISO strings sort chronologically. Needs a migration
  plus a look at the dashboard queries in app/routes/pages.py. Blocks proper
  date arithmetic (e.g. "last 30 days") on the DB side.

Rule learned: any change to game_archive._build_entry needs a
  `flask --app app.main rebuild-game-index` run, or existing archives silently
  report defaults for the new field instead of real values.

